commit 3881547bf9b59484d24c3bdc056db2da429b4eb3
Author: Amit Aryeh Levy <amit@amitlevy.com>
Date:   Thu Aug 30 15:09:47 2018 -0400

    Use Cell instead of MapCell to store arch details

    I don't have a great explanation for why MapCell causes a fault and Cell
    doesn't, but my guess is that there is undefined behavior somewhere in
    MapCell's implementation, and that is causing the compiler to do
    unexpected things in unexpected places.

    Switching to Cell fixes the bugs that manifest for now.

